<html>
  <head>
    <title>R&oslash;vhult - Ein international bekanntes Spiel (alias Arsehole, ...)</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Documentation of the R&oslash;vhult cardgame">
    <meta name="keywords" content="Documentation, Docu, Rovhult, R&oslash;vhult, game, card, cardgame">

    <meta name="DC.Creator" content="Markus Schwab">
